Dear Refilwe Mokoena,

Warm greetings from all of us at Protea Bank and thank you for choosing us as the banking partner for Mzansi Plumbing.

Edition November 2026 brings product news, practical tips and community stories for small business owners like you.

Product news: We have improved our business savings pocket so you can now set monthly goals and track progress in the app. There is also a new invoicing tool that lets you send quotes and match payments with ease.

Seasonal tip: As summer rains arrive, check stock levels early and service work vehicles before the busy festive season. A small maintenance plan now can help avoid delays in December and keep your teams on the road.

We also share customer stories each month to celebrate local craft and service. Thank you for the care you show your clients across Gauteng.

